commit 189d9908aacfc7ee7887f080e405b0a0af196c5e
Author: Ilkay Gül <igul@Mac.localdomain>
Date:   Mon Nov 16 01:28:34 2026 +0100

    viogpu3d: F95 masked-color hardware cursor, INF HWCursor=1 [skip ci]
    
    - PointerCaps.MaskedColor: alpha 0x00 = opaque RGB, 0xFF + black =
      transparent; a shape with real XOR (screen inversion) is refused so
      Windows keeps drawing that one in software (exact rendering).
    - viogpu3d.inx writes HWCursor=1 (a fresh install no longer turns the
      hardware cursor off).
    Measured: masked-color test cursor 0 DWM frames while moving (F94: a
    ~30-frame burst per shape change), inverting shape stays software.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/viogpu/viogpu3d/viogpu3d.inx b/viogpu/viogpu3d/viogpu3d.inx
